  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mozambique Empowering Communities fase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at building resilience in selected rural communities in Mozambique and will include strong elements of climate change adaptation with natural resource management, access to energy and financial inclusion  of low income households. The program includes various activities and outputs with the aim of strengthening women&#x2019;s rights and reducing gender inequality.</narrative>
  </description>
